package api

var sswCurriculumFisheryBodies5English = map[examSSWEnglishKey]string{
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Kematian meningkat tajam dan beberapa ikan berenang tidak normal. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: laporkan segera dengan data unit waktu gejala dan kualitas air. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Amati kelompok dan catat gejala; Periksa data air serta riwayat; Laporkan untuk penilaian berwenang; Ikuti pengendalian dan penanganan kematian. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                      `Consider this work situation: Mortality has risen sharply, and some fish are swimming abnormally. Recommended decision: report immediately with the unit, time, symptoms, and water-quality data. Follow an orderly process: observe the group and record symptoms; check water data and history; report for assessment by authorized staff; follow controls and mortal-fish handling procedures. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Kotak hasil terkena tumpahan bahan bakar. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: pisahkan hasil terdampak dan laporkan untuk keputusan produk. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa identitas hasil dan wadah bersih; Tangani lembut sesuai spesies; Dinginkan menurut prosedur produk; Catat waktu serta penyimpangan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                                                     `Consider this work situation: A catch container has been contaminated by a fuel spill. Recommended decision: isolate the affected catch and report it for a product-safety decision. Follow an orderly process: verify the catch identity and clean container; handle gently according to species; cool according to product procedure; record the time and deviation. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Label benih tidak cocok dengan dokumen pengiriman. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: pisahkan penerimaan dan konfirmasikan identitas sebelum dicampur. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Cocokkan dokumen lot dan spesies; Periksa jumlah ukuran serta kondisi; Tempatkan sesuai prosedur penerimaan; Catat asal dan unit tujuan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                                           `Consider this work situation: The juvenile-stock label does not match the shipping documents. Recommended decision: keep the delivery separate and confirm its identity before mixing it with other stock. Follow an orderly process: match the lot and species to the documents; check quantity, size, and condition; place the stock according to receiving procedures; record its origin and receiving unit. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Pelampung memiliki pengikat rusak sebelum tugas di geladak. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: laporkan dan ganti dengan alat yang layak sesuai prosedur. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa jenis ukuran dan kondisi pelampung; Pakai serta kencangkan sesuai petunjuk; Gunakan jalur dan pegangan aman; Laporkan kerusakan atau bahaya geladak. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                     `Consider this work situation: A life jacket has a damaged strap before a deck assignment. Recommended decision: report it and replace it with suitable equipment under procedure. Follow an orderly process: check the life jacket type, size, and condition; wear and fasten it as directed; use safe routes and handholds; report damage or deck hazards. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Pengikat keramba rusak dan arus menguat. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: batasi kegiatan berisiko dan laporkan untuk penanganan terkoordinasi. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa unit akses dan cuaca; Amati sarana serta jalur air; Laporkan kerusakan sebelum operasi berisiko; Ikuti perbaikan oleh petugas berwenang. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                                         `Consider this work situation: A cage mooring is damaged as the current strengthens. Recommended decision: restrict risky activity and report the issue for coordinated handling. Follow an orderly process: check the unit, access, and weather; inspect the facilities and water routes; report damage before hazardous operations; leave repairs to authorized staff. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Rekan jatuh ke laut dan kamu adalah saksi pertama. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: beri alarm serta laporkan lokasi sambil mengamati dari posisi aman. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Beri alarm sesuai prosedur kapal; Laporkan lokasi dan pertahankan pengamatan aman; Gunakan alat bantuan sesuai instruksi; Ikuti koordinasi serta pencatatan awak. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                `Consider this work situation: A coworker falls overboard, and you are the first witness. Recommended decision: raise the alarm and report the location while observing from a safe position. Follow an orderly process: raise the alarm under vessel procedure; report the location and maintain visual contact if safe; use rescue equipment as directed; follow crew coordination and recordkeeping. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Rekan menganggap kerang tidak diberi pakan sehingga tak perlu pemeriksaan. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: tetap periksa lingkungan kondisi organisme dan fasilitas. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Identifikasi spesies sistem dan kelompok; Baca rencana siklus produksi; Kerjakan pemeliharaan sesuai jalur; Catat perubahan dan hasil. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                             `Consider this work situation: A coworker assumes shellfish need no checks because they are not fed. Recommended decision: continue checking the environment, organisms, and facilities. Follow an orderly process: identify the species, system, and lot; review the production-cycle plan; maintain stock according to the designated procedure; record changes and results. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Respons makan turun dan banyak pakan tersisa. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: laporkan dan ikuti penyesuaian yang disetujui berdasarkan kondisi. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa rencana pakan dan kondisi air; Pastikan mutu pakan serta kelompok; Berikan sesuai SOP sambil mengamati respons; Catat aktual sisa dan perubahan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                               `Consider this work situation: Feeding response has declined, and much feed remains uneaten. Recommended decision: report the change and follow adjustments approved for the conditions. Follow an orderly process: check the feed plan and water conditions; confirm feed quality and lot; feed according to SOP while observing the response; record actual leftovers and changes. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Robekan jaring terdeteksi saat cuaca memburuk. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: laporkan dan ikuti rencana pengamanan tanpa masuk air spontan. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa jaring pengikat dan akses aman; Catat robekan serta penempel; Koordinasikan perawatan sesuai SOP; Periksa unit dan jumlah setelah tindakan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}:                                       `Consider this work situation: A net tear is detected as the weather worsens. Recommended decision: report it and follow the securing plan; do not enter the water spontaneously. Follow an orderly process: inspect net ties and safe access; record the tear and fouling; coordinate maintenance according to SOP; check the unit and stock count afterward. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
	{field: "ssw.body", source: `Bayangkan kondisi kerja berikut: Rumput laut berubah warna dan penempel meningkat pada unit padat. Keputusan yang dianjurkan adalah: catat dan laporkan kondisi untuk penilaian lingkungan serta pemeliharaan. Lakukan alur secara teratur: Periksa spesies fase dan sarana tali; Amati kondisi lingkungan serta kepadatan; Rawat sesuai rencana komoditas; Catat pertumbuhan serta perubahan jaringan. Catat kondisi sebelum dan sesudah tindakan, lokasi atau kelompok yang terdampak, waktu pengamatan, serta siapa yang diberi laporan. Jika hasil berbeda dari rencana, hentikan bagian yang berisiko dan minta arahan penanggung jawab sebelum mengubah metode. Angka target, dosis produk, setelan alat, dan batas cuaca mengikuti instruksi lokasi, label, serta jenis tanaman atau hewan; contoh belajar bukan angka universal.`}: `Consider this work situation: Seaweed is changing color, and fouling is increasing in a densely stocked unit. Recommended decision: record and report the condition for environmental assessment and maintenance. Follow an orderly process: check the species, growth stage, and line facilities; observe environmental conditions and density; maintain the crop according to its plan; record growth and tissue changes. Record conditions before and after the action, the affected location or group, observation time, and who received the report. If the result differs from the plan, stop the risky part and ask the person in charge for direction before changing the method. Target values, product doses, equipment settings, and weather limits depend on site instructions, product labels, and the species; practice examples are not universal values.`,
}
